Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:47.00,Tip,,0,0,0,,尤特加人不会成为猎物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.79,0:00:47.00,Tip,,0,0,0,,不交朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:47.00,Tip,,0,0,0,,掠食万物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:47.00,Tip,,0,0,0,,-尤特加法典
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.90,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs30\fad(2800,1000)}尤特加\h\h\h母星\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.83,0:02:46.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,我感应到你了 哥\N{\rEng}I sense you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.91,0:02:54.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,躲在\N{\rEng}Hiding...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.33,0:02:59.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,你的斗篷后面\N{\rEng}behind your cloak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:04.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,你该设法争取自己的斗篷了\N{\rEng}It is time to earn yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.87,0:03:17.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,你还是太小 对付不了我\N{\rEng}Still too small to take me head on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.08,0:03:19.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,利用这个洞穴\N{\rEng}Use the cave!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.66,0:03:35.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,你凭着怒火对抗我\N{\rEng}You fight with rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:37.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,我跟父亲一样战斗\N{\rEng}I fight like father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.50,0:03:41.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,你不是父亲 你是戴克\N{\rEng}You are not father, you are Dek!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:35.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,你要投降吗？\N{\rEng}Do you yield?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:37.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,做梦\N{\rEng}Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.87,0:04:39.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\rEng}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:10.62,Chs,,0,0,0,,我还活着 哥\N{\rEng}I'm still alive, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:15.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,你还有很多要证明\N{\rEng}Still much to prove...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:17.62,Chs,,0,0,0,,才能展现你的能耐\N{\rEng}to show who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:20.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,我是尤特加战士\N{\rEng}I am Yautja.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:24.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,还不是\N{\rEng}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.62,0:05:28.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,你要拿你的剑吗 酷威？\N{\rEng}Are you holding your sword, Kwei?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:31.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:33.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,拿起来\N{\rEng}Pick it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:05.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,你留着这个玩具？\N{\rEng}You kept this toy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.45,0:06:08.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,你记得当时的情况\N{\rEng}You remember what happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.29,0:06:12.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,我失去了我的尖牙\N{\rEng}I lost my fang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:16.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,你救了我一命\N{\rEng}And you saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.41,0:06:20.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,你保护我\N{\rEng}You protected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:21.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\rEng}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:32.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,我帮你修好了\N{\rEng}Fixed it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.41,0:06:37.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,别炸死自己\N{\rEng}Don't blow yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:50.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,今天你发誓\N{\rEng}Today you make a vow...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.91,0:06:59.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,就跟我们的祖先一样\N{\rEng}as our ancestors did before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.75,0:07:03.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,争取你在家族中的地位\N{\rEng}To earn your place in the clan...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:05.62,Chs,,0,0,0,,你必须选择你的猎物\N{\rEng}you must choose your prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.12,0:07:09.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,带它回家\N{\rEng}Bring it home...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.33,0:07:13.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,否则就别回来了\N{\rEng}or never return.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:22.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,等等 倒回去\N{\rEng}Wait - Go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.62,0:07:28.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,干纳星\N{\rEng}Genna.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:30.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,死亡星球\N{\rEng}The death planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.87,0:07:35.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,不死卡里斯克的家乡\N{\rEng}Home of the un-killable Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:41.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,连父亲都怕它\N{\rEng}Even father fears it.Even father fears it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:46.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,那卡里斯克就会是我的战利品\N{\rEng}Then the Kalisk shall be my trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.87,0:07:49.45,Chs,,0,0,0,,父亲说我最弱\N{\rEng}Father calls me the weakest...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:53.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,所以我必须杀死最强的\N{\rEng}so I must kill the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:57.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,失败必死无疑\N{\rEng}Failure means death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:02.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,那我不会失败\N{\rEng}Then I will not fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.62,0:08:04.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,我不许你去\N{\rEng}I cannot allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.75,0:08:10.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,我发誓会成功\N{\rEng}I make my vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:15.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,我发誓会成功\N{\rEng}I make my vow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:11.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\rEng}Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.37,0:09:16.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,很荣幸欢迎你\N{\rEng}I welcome you with honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.75,0:09:31.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,为什么没搞定？\N{\rEng}Why is it not done?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.70,0:09:35.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,他值得一次猎杀的机会\N{\rEng}He deserves a hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:40.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,他是我们家族的弱者\N{\rEng}He is our clan's weakness...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:43.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,弱者必须剔除\N{\rEng}weakness must be culled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:47.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,他会带卡里斯克回家\N{\rEng}He will bring home the Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:51.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,愚蠢\N{\rEng}Foolishness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.45,0:09:53.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,他是窝囊废\N{\rEng}He is a runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:57.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,你该趁他睡觉时杀了他\N{\rEng}You should have done it as he slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:09:59.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\rEng}Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.54,0:10:01.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,现在动手\N{\rEng}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:14.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,他死了才能荣耀我们\N{\rEng}He will only honor us in death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:31.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\rEng}Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:45.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,酷威？\N{\rEng}Kwei?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:48.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,勇敢一点 弟\N{\rEng}Be brave, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:40.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\rEng}Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:51.62,Chs,,0,0,0,,酷威\N{\rEng}Kwei!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:08.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,原谅弱者\N{\rEng}To forgive weakness...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.54,0:12:11.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,就是示弱\N{\rEng}is to show weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.91,0:12:15.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,不 父亲 不要\N{\rEng}No! Father, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.79,0:12:25.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,拿你的剑\N{\rEng}Get your sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:29.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,酷威\N{\rEng}Kwei!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:45.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,发射程序已启动\N{\rEng}Launch sequence initiated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:58.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,带它回家\N{\rEng}Bring it home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.75,0:15:57.43,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs30\fad(1250,0)}干纳星\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:02.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,带它回家\N{\rEng}Bring it home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:07.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,为了酷威\N{\rEng}For Kwei.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.83,0:19:54.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs40\b1\1c&H00004E&\3c&H0000FF&\shad0\bord2\blur2}铁血战士
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.83,0:19:54.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\c&HC1C1C1&}杀\h戮\h之\h地
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.79,0:21:45.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,尤特加人\N{\rEng}Yautja!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.41,0:22:07.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,这样\N{\rEng}Is this... Is this... Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.33,0:22:08.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,这样有比较好吗？\N{\rEng}Is this better?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.75,0:22:12.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,宇宙通用翻译 你听到尤特加语\N{\rEng}Universal translation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.41,0:22:14.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,别人听到他们的语言\N{\rEng}You hear Yautja,others hear their language...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.83,0:22:17.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\rEng}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:20.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,这对你可不妙\N{\rEng}This isn't great for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:43.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,它会等那些针使你瘫痪\N{\rEng}It waitsfor the needles to paralyze you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.37,0:22:46.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,再趁你动弹不得时吃掉你\N{\rEng}Then eats youwhile you can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.25,0:22:56.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,我能帮你 但\N{\rEng}I could help you, but...I need a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.20,0:22:58.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,我需要帮忙\N{\rEng}, but...I need a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.45,0:23:07.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,尤特加人独自狩猎\N{\rEng}Yautja hunt alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.79,0:23:09.45,Chs,,0,0,0,,尤特加人虽然独自狩猎\N{\rEng}Yautja might hunt alone
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.54,0:23:11.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,但也独自死去\N{\rEng}but they die alone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.04,0:23:16.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,卡里斯克\N{\rEng}Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.91,0:23:22.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,你在猎杀卡里斯克\N{\rEng}You're hunting the Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.58,0:23:36.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,最好跑快点\N{\rEng}Gotta run faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.50,0:23:45.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,毒性很快吧？\N{\rEng}It happens fast, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.70,0:23:49.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,如果你有武器 我能用\N{\rEng}If you had a weapon,you know, I could use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.04,0:23:56.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,丢过来 我帮你弄到解药\N{\rEng}Throw me that,and I can get you the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.79,0:24:00.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,不要拉倒\N{\rEng}Now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.66,0:24:39.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\rEng}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.08,0:25:04.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,应该会完好如初\N{\rEng}Should be good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.50,0:25:11.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,毒液让它们开花\N{\rEng}The venom makes them bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.16,0:25:12.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,也让它们成为方便的解药\N{\rEng}Also makes thema handy antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.16,0:25:21.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,拉我一把吧？\N{\rEng}How about a lift?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.83,0:25:26.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,出发\N{\rEng}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.41,0:25:32.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,客气点 先生\N{\rEng}Excuse you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.16,0:25:35.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,你的腿怎么了？\N{\rEng}What happened to your legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.50,0:25:36.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,我是合成人\N{\rEng}I'm synthetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.41,0:25:37.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,我是威兰汤谷企业\N{\rEng}I was built and deployed
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.62,0:25:40.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,为了研究而开发及部署的\N{\rEng}by the Weyland-YutaniCorporation for research.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.45,0:25:43.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,他们的人类在这星球撑不了一天\N{\rEng}Because their humans wouldn'tlast a day on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.12,0:25:44.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们发现\N{\rEng}We found that...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.00,0:25:52.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\rEng}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.04,0:25:56.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,许多尤特加人为了卡里斯克而来\N{\rEng}Many Yautja have comefor the great Kalisk,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.33,0:25:58.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,没有一个活下来\N{\rEng}and none have survived it...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.79,0:26:00.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,或在干纳星生存\N{\rEng}or Genna.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.33,0:26:05.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,我见过卡里斯克\N{\rEng}I've seen the Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.75,0:26:07.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,我活了下来\N{\rEng}I survived it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.50,0:26:11.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,以下是我的建议 你带着我\N{\rEng}Here's my proposal:You take me along with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.37,0:26:13.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,我带你去它的巢穴\N{\rEng}and I'll guide you to its den.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.95,0:26:16.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,到了之后 我得到我的腿\N{\rEng}Once there, I get my legs,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.08,0:26:18.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,你获得战利品\N{\rEng}you get your trophy,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.16,0:26:21.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,皆大欢喜 一言为定罗？\N{\rEng}and everyone's a winner. Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.66,0:26:26.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,你见过卡里斯克？\N{\rEng}You have seen the Kalisk?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.12,0:26:31.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,对 我见过卡里斯克\N{\rEng}Oh, yeah. I've seen the Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.95,0:26:44.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rEng}Okay. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.87,0:26:49.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,祝你旅途顺心\N{\rEng}Good luck with your journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.83,0:26:54.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,我就 自己走自己的\N{\rEng}I'm just gonna...go on my journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.95,0:26:58.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,相信你会想出办法的\N{\rEng}I'm sureyou'll figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.83,0:27:06.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\rEng}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.83,0:27:12.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,我已经证明我对你有用处\N{\rEng}I've already shown youthat I can be useful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.37,0:27:16.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,用处\N{\rEng}Useful...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.33,0:27:17.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,就像工具？\N{\rEng}like tool?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.79,0:27:22.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,对 没错 像工具\N{\rEng}Yes. Yes, exactly, like a tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.91,0:27:25.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,在干纳星存活就得顺势而为\N{\rEng}The only way to survive Gennais to work with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.41,0:27:27.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,我知道怎么做\N{\rEng}and I know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.33,0:27:30.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,只要用对工具\N{\rEng}And with the right tool...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.95,0:27:33.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,你就能逮到卡里斯克\N{\rEng}you could get the Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.58,0:27:35.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,你可以成为第一个\N{\rEng}You could be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.12,0:27:40.62,Chs,,0,0,0,,我会利用你 工具\N{\rEng}I will use you, tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.29,0:27:42.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,你能叫我希\N{\rEng}You may call me Thi... Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.79,0:27:48.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,你好像比其他尤特加人娇小 你几岁？\N{\rEng}You seem smaller than the otherYautja. How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.25,0:27:51.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,你用什么嚼东西？\N{\rEng}And what does the chewing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.91,0:27:54.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,你的外尖牙还是内牙？\N{\rEng}Your outside fangsor your inside teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.20,0:27:58.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,你怎么称呼？\N{\rEng} What should I call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.20,0:28:09.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,我没被人扔过 好刺激\N{\rEng}I've never been thrown before.What a... thrill!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.50,0:28:11.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,你的船坠毁时飞多快？\N{\rEng}How fast were you goingwhen your ship crashed?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.83,0:28:15.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,比亚光速快吗？ 我们还没达到那个速度\N{\rEng}Faster than sub-light speed? We haven't cracked that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.25,0:28:17.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,还有 那把电浆剑很有趣\N{\rEng}Also, that plasma swordis interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.20,0:28:19.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,只有你们家族有吗？\N{\rEng}Is it unique to your clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.12,0:28:20.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,我该怎么叫你？\N{\rEng}And what may I call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.50,0:28:23.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,我称它们为雨蛇\N{\rEng}I call these imbre anguis.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.25,0:28:37.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,它们只想吃点心\N{\rEng}They just want a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.25,0:28:48.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,用蜂蜜比用醋能抓到更多苍蝇\N{\rEng}You catch more flies with honeythan you do with vinegar.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.25,0:28:51.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,我不要苍蝇\N{\rEng}Don't want flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.08,0:28:55.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,掠食生物是我的专业领域\N{\rEng}Predatory organisms aremy specific area of expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.04,0:28:57.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,我广泛研究尤特加族\N{\rEng}I've studied Yautja extensively.It's an impressive culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.95,0:28:59.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,它是个独特的文化
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.50,0:29:03.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,来 随便问 我都有答案\N{\rEng}Here, ask me anything.I bet I have the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.91,0:29:07.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,真好笑\N{\rEng}Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.41,0:29:09.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,你还没说你的名字\N{\rEng}And you still haven'ttold me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.62,0:29:32.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,我叫戴克\N{\rEng}Name is Dek.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.37,0:29:35.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,现在朝那边说话\N{\rEng}Now talk that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.25,0:29:37.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,好 没问题\N{\rEng}Okay, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.95,0:29:41.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,好 倒回去 话说从头\N{\rEng}Well, let's back upand start at the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.25,0:29:45.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,干纳星在640亿周期前形成\N{\rEng}Genna was formed64 billion cycles ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.41,0:29:48.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,当时邻近星系中的一颗垂死红矮星\N{\rEng}when a dying red dwarf starin a neighboring system...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.12,0:30:03.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,真的好美\N{\rEng}It's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.75,0:30:06.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,困在这里这么久\N{\rEng}After all the timeI've been stuck here,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.29,0:30:08.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,这个景色还是看不腻\N{\rEng}I never get tired of the view.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.45,0:30:12.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,你在这里多久了？\N{\rEng}How long have you been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.25,0:30:15.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们两年前抵达干纳星 建造一座基地\N{\rEng}Well, we arrived on Genna twoyears ago, and we built a base.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.95,0:30:20.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,然后我在兀鹰巢里度过人生中\N{\rEng}Then, I was inthe vulture's nest for the most exciting
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.37,0:30:25.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,最刺激的13天7小时43分2秒\N{\rEng}13 days, seven hours, 43 minutes and two seconds of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.16,0:30:29.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,但我始终明白有人会来\N{\rEng}But I always knewsomeone would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.12,0:30:32.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,只是猜错了是谁\N{\rEng}I was just wrong about who.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.91,0:30:35.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,谁会来？\N{\rEng}Who would come?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.08,0:30:40.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,泰莎\N{\rEng}Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.95,0:30:45.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们团队完全由合成人组成\N{\rEng}Our crew is made upentirely of synths.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.58,0:30:47.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,但泰莎和我比较特别\N{\rEng}But Tessa and I are special.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.04,0:30:50.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们比其他人更敏感\N{\rEng}We have a higher sensitivitythan the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.70,0:30:53.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,敏感是弱点\N{\rEng}Sensitivity is weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.33,0:31:00.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,敏感让我们能理解这星球上的生物\N{\rEng}Sensitivity is what allows usto understand the creatures on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.16,0:31:06.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们原本就是要协力合作\N{\rEng}We were createdto work in tandem.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.20,0:31:11.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,我专注在实验室里 泰莎在野外\N{\rEng}Me, cooped up in the lab,Tessa out in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.29,0:31:14.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,直到那美妙的一天 泰莎让我与她同行\N{\rEng}Until the wonderful dayTessa let me come with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.75,0:31:16.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们在探索干纳星\N{\rEng}We were exploring Genna.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.33,0:31:21.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,接着卡里斯克攻击我们\N{\rEng}And then the Kalisk attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.58,0:31:26.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,害我一分为二 也拆散了我们\N{\rEng}Separated me... and us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.66,0:31:30.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,我记得最后听到的声音\N{\rEng}The last soundI remember hearing
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.75,0:31:35.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,是泰莎呼喊我的名字\N{\rEng}was Tessa calling out my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.83,0:31:37.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,向我伸出手\N{\rEng}Reaching for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.29,0:31:41.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,然后卡里斯克出现\N{\rEng}Then the Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.29,0:31:43.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,我不知所措\N{\rEng}I didn't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.16,0:31:57.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,我不肯相信她死了\N{\rEng}But I refuseto believe she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.58,0:32:15.08,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an6\fs18\i1}气密舱\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.62,0:32:31.58,Tip,,0,0,0,,系统已连接\h\h\h\h实验单位重启中...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.62,0:32:31.58,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an6}\N\N受试者：泰莎\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.62,0:32:31.58,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an2}威兰汤谷生物武器部
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.00,0:32:35.21,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fr6}\N\N\N\N状态查询
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.54,0:32:35.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,希亚\N{\rEng}Thia, Thia,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.25,0:32:37.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,希亚\N{\rEng}Thia, Thia, Thia...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.33,0:32:39.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,希亚\N{\rEng}Thia, Thia, Thia...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.54,0:32:45.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,希亚\N{\rEng}Thia, Thia, Thia, Thia.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.00,0:32:47.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,希亚\N{\rEng}Thia, Thia.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.91,0:32:55.91,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an7}状态：受损
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.62,0:32:55.91,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an4}核心功能：可用
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.65,0:32:55.95,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an1}任务未完成
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.95,0:32:58.58,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an5}任务未完成\N\N\N\N
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.80,0:33:06.66,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\fs16}首要任务仍然是：
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.80,0:33:06.66,Tip,,0,0,0,,- 获取\hXX0522\h样本
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.50,0:33:06.66,Tip,,0,0,0,,- 确保取回生物武器
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.41,0:33:12.08,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an7}注意
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.08,0:33:17.66,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an7}注意：侦测到新生命型态
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.58,0:33:17.66,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an4}物种：尤特加人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.58,0:33:17.66,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an1}对任务有潜在威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.66,0:33:20.45,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an2}对任务有潜在威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.95,0:33:28.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,你好 泰莎\N{\rEng}Hello, Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.04,0:33:31.62,Chs,,0,0,0,,公司并不满意\N{\rEng}The Company is not pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.50,0:33:36.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,持续失败将导致你退役\N{\rEng}Continued failure will resultin your decommission.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.45,0:33:42.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,希亚在哪里？\N{\rEng}Where's Thia?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.58,0:33:47.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,尤特加人带走希亚\N{\rEng}The Yautja has Thia.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.66,0:34:00.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,我必须吃东西\N{\rEng}I must eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.04,0:34:04.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,两名战士 戴克与希亚 狩猎中\N{\rEng}Two warriors.Dek and Thia, on the hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.25,0:34:09.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,问一下 我该做什么？\N{\rEng}Quick question. What should I be doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.45,0:34:15.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,这是什么生物？\N{\rEng}What is this creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.95,0:34:19.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,骨野牛 它们是卡里斯克的食物\N{\rEng}Bone bison.They're Kalisk food.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.29,0:34:24.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,那也会是我的食物\N{\rEng}Then it will be my food, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.91,0:34:28.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,好刺激 跟尤特加人一起狩猎\N{\rEng}So exciting.Hunting with a Yautja.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.79,0:34:30.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,泰莎绝对不相信\N{\rEng}Tessa wouldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.00,0:34:33.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,警告你一下\N{\rEng}Just a warning...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:23.00,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs16\fad(0,700)}字幕制作：{\fs20\1c&HFF8646&\3c&HAE1C14&\bord10\blur10}葫  芦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.33,0:34:34.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,给我安静\N{\rEng}Quiet tool!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.45,0:34:39.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,剃刀草\N{\rEng}Razor grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.08,0:34:45.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,会把你割成肉条 我们绕过去\N{\rEng}It'll cut you to ribbons.We'll just go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.75,0:34:51.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,你太容易放弃了\N{\rEng}You give up too easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.08,0:34:57.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,这趟狩猎恐怕不只有我们\N{\rEng}We might not be alonein this hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.66,0:35:11.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,好奇怪的小动物 我没见过你\N{\rEng}What an odd critter. I've never seen you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.70,0:35:18.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,我是希亚 你好\N{\rEng}Thia. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.62,0:35:35.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,看来你的竞争对手比较\N{\rEng}Looks like your competitionis better...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.37,0:35:56.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,小心这些树上有月虫\N{\rEng}Careful up in these trees.There are Luna bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.25,0:36:18.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,从你后面来了\N{\rEng}Coming up behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.25,0:36:33.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,别小看它\N{\rEng}Stronger than it looks!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.45,0:36:46.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,戴克？\N{\rEng}Uh, Dek?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.62,0:36:49.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,戴克 你看\N{\rEng}Dek! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.41,0:37:34.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,卡里斯克？\N{\rEng}Kalisk?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.58,0:37:35.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,不是卡里斯克\N{\rEng}Not a Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.04,0:37:40.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,这个就是月虫\N{\rEng}This is a Luna bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.16,0:37:49.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,有其他武器吗？\N{\rEng}Have any other weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.54,0:38:48.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,怎么停下来？ 快闪人\N{\rEng}Why'd you stop? Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.04,0:38:50.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,你太容易放弃了\N{\rEng}You give up too easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.70,0:40:43.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,那是我参与过最棒的狩猎\N{\rEng}That was the best huntI've ever been on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.66,0:40:45.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们是梦幻队伍\N{\rEng}This is the dream teamright here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.20,0:40:49.45,Chs,,0,0,0,,超杀三人组 超杀三小队 超杀三巨头\N{\rEng}The Dynamic Three.The Dynamic Trio. The Dynamic Tree-
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.54,0:40:51.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,三巨头 记得我们从树上掉下来吗？\N{\rEng}Tree- Remember whenwe went down the tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.75,0:40:53.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,那头怪兽的嘴\N{\rEng}That monster's mouth, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.79,0:40:56.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,味道不好闻 不过\N{\rEng}Didn't smell great,didn't smell great. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.83,0:41:00.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们击败它 搞定它 然后遇见你\N{\rEng}We got him. We got him.And then we met you,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.91,0:41:03.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们的小可爱\N{\rEng}our little sweet,little, little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.66,0:41:06.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,真的 谢谢你给我这次经验\N{\rEng}Thank you, seriously,for that experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.16,0:41:08.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,真不可思议 超刺激\N{\rEng}Truly amazing. Thrilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.87,0:41:11.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,好刺激 你最喜欢哪个部分？\N{\rEng}Truly thrilling.What was your favorite part?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.37,0:41:18.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,我用剑刺进它的头\N{\rEng}When I pierced its head with my sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.50,0:41:22.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,它的血从我脸上滚滚流下\N{\rEng}and its blood rushed down my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.45,0:41:25.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,酷\N{\rEng}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.58,0:41:38.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,谢了 我不吃东西 但这样好甜蜜喔\N{\rEng} No, thanks. I don't eat,but that's very sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.00,0:41:42.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,这种肉并不甜\N{\rEng}This flesh is not sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.50,0:41:44.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\rEng}Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.83,0:41:51.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们的小朋友好像饿了\N{\rEng}Our little bud herelooks hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.41,0:42:06.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,我想它是把你当成自己人\N{\rEng}I think she's marking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.87,0:42:09.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,它要你成为它家族的一员\N{\rEng}She wants youto be a part of her clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.12,0:42:12.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,说不定它迷路了\N{\rEng}Maybe she's lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.08,0:42:14.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,我没有家族\N{\rEng}I have no clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.50,0:42:18.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,什么意思 尤特加人没家人吗？\N{\rEng}What do you mean?Don't all Yautja have family?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.66,0:42:20.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,没家族\N{\rEng}No clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.20,0:42:24.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,从来没人关照你吗？\N{\rEng}So you never had anyonelooking out for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.70,0:42:29.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,我曾经有一个哥哥\N{\rEng}I had a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.33,0:42:31.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,曾经？\N{\rEng}Had?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.45,0:42:35.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,他怎么了？\N{\rEng}What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.75,0:42:41.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,父亲杀了他\N{\rEng}Father killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.20,0:42:45.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,你正在悲痛中\N{\rEng}You're grieving.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.12,0:42:49.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,悲痛是弱点\N{\rEng}Grief is weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.00,0:42:55.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,你失去哥哥才来这里\N{\rEng}You're herebecause you lost your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.29,0:42:59.62,Chs,,0,0,0,,我为了卡里斯克而来\N{\rEng}I am here for Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.70,0:43:04.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,你为什么来这里？\N{\rEng}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.41,0:43:12.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,因为与你同行是回去找泰莎最好的办法\N{\rEng}I'm herebecause traveling with you is the best wayto get back to Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.50,0:43:18.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,我在兀鹰巢时 好怕再也见不到她\N{\rEng}When I wasin that vulture's nest, I was so afraidI would never see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.33,0:43:22.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,你自己应该活得下去\N{\rEng}You should be able to survive on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.79,0:43:26.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,我能靠自己生存\N{\rEng}I can survive on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.50,0:43:29.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,但谁会想自己活下去？\N{\rEng}But who would wantto survive on their own?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.83,0:43:37.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,泰莎是你的姊妹\N{\rEng}Tessa is your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.91,0:43:43.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,姊妹\N{\rEng}Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.29,0:43:47.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,对\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.12,0:43:49.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,我想是吧\N{\rEng}I guess she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.62,0:43:54.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,我有 一个姊妹\N{\rEng}I have... a sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.66,0:43:59.62,Chs,,0,0,0,,好动人的想法\N{\rEng}What a lovely thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.58,0:44:06.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,我必须找到她\N{\rEng}I need to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.33,0:44:09.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,还有腿\N{\rEng}And legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.70,0:44:12.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\rEng}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.20,0:44:14.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,找到你的姊妹\N{\rEng}Find your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.83,0:44:17.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,还有你的腿\N{\rEng}And legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.08,0:44:21.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,这是笑话吗？\N{\rEng}Was that a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.66,0:47:41.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,太阳出来了\N{\rEng}The sun rises.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.62,0:47:43.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\rEng}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.95,0:47:45.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们不能丢下小巴\N{\rEng}We can't leave Bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.20,0:47:47.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,小巴？\N{\rEng}Bud?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.25,0:47:50.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,对 小巴 我帮它取了名字\N{\rEng}Yeah, Bud. I named her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.12,0:47:53.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,尤特加人单独狩猎\N{\rEng}Yautja hunt alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.16,0:47:57.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,才怪 我陪着你\N{\rEng}You're not alone, I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.83,0:48:00.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,你是工具\N{\rEng}You're a tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.54,0:48:08.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,要是没有它 那棵树会吃了我们\N{\rEng}The tree would have eaten uswithout her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.79,0:48:14.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,现在我们不在树上\N{\rEng}We're not in the tree now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.79,0:49:11.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,卡里斯克？\N{\rEng}Kalisk?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.41,0:49:19.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,它在这里喝水\N{\rEng}It drinks here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.58,0:49:23.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,它在这里喝水？\N{\rEng}It drinks here?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.87,0:49:30.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,你不说话就成了没用的工具\N{\rEng}You are a useless tool if you don't speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.04,0:49:37.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,小巴救了我们\N{\rEng}Bud saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.20,0:49:42.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,它吐你口水代表你是它家人\N{\rEng}She spit on you to claim youas part of her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.08,0:49:50.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,你父亲为何杀你哥？\N{\rEng}Why'd your fatherkill your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.54,0:50:00.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,我哥想保护我\N{\rEng}My brother was protecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.66,0:50:09.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,家族不能有弱者\N{\rEng}The clan can have no weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.20,0:50:12.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,我会展现力量给他们看\N{\rEng}I will show them strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.95,0:50:20.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,在地球上\N{\rEng}On Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.62,0:50:23.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,有种掠食动物叫狼\N{\rEng}there's a predator knownas the wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.91,0:50:25.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,是一种强大的动物\N{\rEng}It's a powerful creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.50,0:50:29.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,它们成群狩猎\N{\rEng}They hunt in packs.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.54,0:50:31.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,忠心耿耿\N{\rEng}They're very loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.95,0:50:35.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,狼群领袖是头狼\N{\rEng}The leader of the packis the alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.95,0:50:37.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,是最强势的\N{\rEng}Known as the most dominant.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.04,0:50:39.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,狼\N{\rEng}Wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.91,0:50:42.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,头狼一定是厉害的杀手\N{\rEng}This alpha must be a great killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.37,0:50:46.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,我也会猎杀它 -不\N{\rEng}I will hunt it too. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.95,0:50:50.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,头狼不是最会杀戮的\N{\rEng}The alpha isn't the wolfwho kills the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.29,0:50:57.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,头狼其实是最能保护狼群的\N{\rEng}The alpha is actually the onewho best protects the pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.91,0:51:00.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,我懂了\N{\rEng}I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.87,0:51:07.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,但我将是最会杀戮的头狼\N{\rEng}But I will be the alphathat kills the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.62,0:51:43.45,Chs,,0,0,0,,卡里斯克的巢穴？\N{\rEng}The Kalisk's den?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.87,0:52:13.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,他们是谁？\N{\rEng}Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.29,0:52:17.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,威兰汤谷合成人\N{\rEng}Weyland-Yutani synths.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.12,0:52:22.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,卡里斯克摧毁我们大半个任务团队\N{\rEng}The Kalisk destroyedmost of our mission team.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.41,0:52:28.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,找到我了\N{\rEng}There I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.20,0:53:13.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,现在走路比较轻松了\N{\rEng}Easier to walk now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.62,0:53:15.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,快了\N{\rEng}It's about to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.87,0:53:17.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\rEng}No.No.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.29,0:53:20.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,现在我走路比较轻松了\N{\rEng}Easier for me to walk now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.70,0:53:25.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,当然 对\N{\rEng} Of course. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.54,0:53:29.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 戴克\N{\rEng}Thank you, Dek.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.58,0:53:34.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,我不会忘记的\N{\rEng}I'm never gonna forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.75,0:53:39.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,我也会记得\N{\rEng}I too will remember this...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.70,0:53:43.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,今天我成为尤特加战士戴克\N{\rEng}today I become Dek of the Yautja.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.33,0:53:47.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,我会表扬酷威\N{\rEng}I will honor Kwei...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.75,0:53:52.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,等我带卡里斯克回家\N{\rEng}when I bring the Kalisk home.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.08,0:53:57.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,然后尝到复仇的滋味\N{\rEng}Then I taste revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.87,0:54:02.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,你会抢先看见我的战利品\N{\rEng}You will be the first to see my trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.16,0:54:06.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,那对你来说是\N{\rEng}It is a great honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.20,0:54:08.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,莫大的荣幸\N{\rEng}For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.75,0:54:12.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,戴克 我得告诉你一件事\N{\rEng}Dek, there's somethingI have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.95,0:54:15.45,Chs,,0,0,0,,你必须离开了\N{\rEng}You need to leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.83,0:54:18.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,定位信标已激活\N{\rEng}Location beacon activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.04,0:54:19.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.20,0:54:23.00,Tip,,0,0,0,,信标已激活
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.85,0:54:23.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,我通知泰莎 公司快过来了\N{\rEng}I called Tessa.The company is on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.12,0:54:24.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,他们抵达时你不能在这里\N{\rEng}You can't be herewhen they arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.08,0:54:28.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,我是来找卡里斯克的\N{\rEng}I came here for the Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.33,0:54:31.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,我也是 戴克\N{\rEng}So did I, Dek.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.62,0:54:35.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,公司派我们来逮捕卡里斯克\N{\rEng}The company sent us hereto capture the Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.00,0:54:38.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,你要我的战利品\N{\rEng}You want my trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.79,0:54:43.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,卡里斯克在哪？\N{\rEng}Where is the Kalisk?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.20,0:54:48.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,戴克 你不能杀它\N{\rEng}Dek, you can't kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.54,0:54:53.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,我利用你 工具 不是你利用我\N{\rEng}I use you, tool. You do not use me!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.12,0:54:54.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你该走了\N{\rEng}I'm sorry. You have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.83,0:54:58.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙带我过来\N{\rEng}I needed youto help bring me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.12,0:55:00.62,Chs,,0,0,0,,是我利用你\N{\rEng}I use you!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.58,0:55:05.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,卡里斯克在哪里？\N{\rEng}Where is the Kalisk?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.12,0:55:06.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,我是在帮你 戴克\N{\rEng}I'm trying to help you, Dek.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.83,0:55:12.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,你想你哥救你是为了让你死在这里吗？\N{\rEng}You think your brothersaved your life just so you could die here?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.50,0:55:18.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,那我会死得很光荣\N{\rEng}Then my death will be honorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.33,0:55:26.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,通知你的姊妹\N{\rEng}Call your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.29,0:55:29.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,谁都不能阻止我\N{\rEng}None can stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.25,0:57:54.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\rEng}Ugh! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.58,0:58:42.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,戴克\N{\rEng}Dek!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.00,0:58:57.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,救你自己 工具\N{\rEng}Save yourself, tool!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.91,1:00:55.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,工具 帮我解开\N{\rEng}Tool, get these off!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.20,1:01:05.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,你不是希亚\N{\rEng}You are not Thia.You are not Thia.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.58,1:01:19.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\rEng}Release me!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.37,1:01:25.45,Chs,,0,0,0,,你也是一个损坏的工具\N{\rEng}You are another broken tool!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.45,1:01:30.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,尤特加族会剔除弱者 你怎么没事？\N{\rEng}The Yautja cull their weak.Why were you spared?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.54,1:01:42.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,拿掉这些东西\N{\rEng}Remove these!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.50,1:01:48.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,否则我扯烂你脊椎 压碎你头颅\N{\rEng}Or I'll rip out your spineand crush your skull!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.83,1:01:51.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,我看过希亚的日志\N{\rEng}I read Thia's logs.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.20,1:01:56.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,你没跟她说过你哥为何保护你\N{\rEng}You never told herwhy your brother protected you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.37,1:02:02.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,你什么都不是 只是一台装置\N{\rEng}You are nothing. A device.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.95,1:02:07.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,别人制造你 把你当打手\N{\rEng}Made by others to do their work for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.16,1:02:09.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.41,1:02:14.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,你现在是威兰汤谷企业的资产\N{\rEng}And you are now property of theWeyland-Yutani Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.95,1:02:18.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,对你来说 是莫大的荣幸\N{\rEng}It is a great honor. For you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.87,1:02:52.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,泰莎\N{\rEng}Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.20,1:02:56.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,你赶来了\N{\rEng}You made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.16,1:02:59.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们赶来了\N{\rEng}We made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.70,1:03:05.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,我见到好多事情\N{\rEng}I've seen so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.87,1:03:09.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,我有好多话要告诉你\N{\rEng}I have so much to tell you.I saw such incredible creatures.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.16,1:03:12.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,我看到惊人的动物
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.16,1:03:16.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,尤特加人是超棒的旅伴\N{\rEng}The Yautja is a greattravelling companion.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.08,1:03:21.45,Chs,,0,0,0,,希亚 关于卡里斯克你说得对\N{\rEng}Thia.You were right about the Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.54,1:03:24.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,你背叛我\N{\rEng}You betrayed me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.29,1:03:27.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,那只动物是再生奇蹟\N{\rEng}The creatureis a regenerative miracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.62,1:03:30.62,Chs,,0,0,0,,人类会感谢我们\N{\rEng}Humanity will thank us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.75,1:03:35.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们抓到卡里斯克了？\N{\rEng}We have the Kalisk?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.33,1:03:36.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,对\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.45,1:03:39.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,母亲会很高兴你多逮到一个\N{\rEng}And Muthur will be pleasedwith your additional catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.45,1:03:48.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,多逮到一个？\N{\rEng}Additional catch?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.12,1:03:59.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,尤特加人不是理想的样本\N{\rEng}The Yautjais not an ideal specimen.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.25,1:04:05.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,没错 不理想\N{\rEng}No, not ideal.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.37,1:04:35.45,Chs,,0,0,0,,但它的科技很有价值\N{\rEng}But its technology is valuable.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.58,1:04:39.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们能利用它的武器 丢下那个尤特加人\N{\rEng}We can salvage its weaponsand leave the Yautja.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.79,1:04:43.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\rEng}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.29,1:04:49.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,但它严重变形\N{\rEng}But it's so malformed.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.75,1:04:53.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们需要一个样本 用来研究\N{\rEng}We're going to need a sample.For research.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.75,1:05:06.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,他不是我们的任务目标\N{\rEng}He was not the goalof our mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.87,1:05:12.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,泰莎 他残缺不堪\N{\rEng}Tessa, he is deficient.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.75,1:05:15.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,泰莎\N{\rEng}Tessa!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.75,1:05:35.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,希亚 这是我们收到的要求\N{\rEng}Thia,this is what is asked of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.25,1:05:42.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们能超出他们的要求\N{\rEng}We can be morethan what they ask of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.87,1:05:48.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们能做什么？\N{\rEng}What can we be?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.95,1:05:52.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,当姊妹\N{\rEng}Sisters.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.00,1:06:10.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,希亚\N{\rEng}Thia.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.16,1:06:25.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,知道母亲为何给我们感情吗？\N{\rEng}Do you know whyMuthur gave us feelings?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.37,1:06:31.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,这样我们才能了解这星球的生物\N{\rEng}So we could understandthe creatures on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.50,1:06:38.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,好利用它们 -利用它们\N{\rEng}- And exploit them.- Exploit them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.20,1:06:41.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,这个尤特加人不一样\N{\rEng}The Yautja is different.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.95,1:06:49.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,他救了我 就像你救了我\N{\rEng}He rescued me.Like you rescued me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.91,1:06:53.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,我不是来这里救你的\N{\rEng}I did not come hereto rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.66,1:06:56.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,我是要完成任务\N{\rEng}I am completing our mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.45,1:07:00.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,第一次面对卡里斯克时\N{\rEng}When we first faced the Kalisk,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.75,1:07:03.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,我试图保护你\N{\rEng}I tried to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.87,1:07:08.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,那差点害我赔上一切\N{\rEng}And that almost cost meeverything.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.87,1:07:12.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,什么意思 泰莎？\N{\rEng}What do you mean, Tessa?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.12,1:07:17.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,我差点犯下跟尤特加人的哥哥一样的错\N{\rEng}I almost made the same mistakethe Yautja's brother made.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.75,1:07:21.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,弱者必须剔除\N{\rEng}The weak must be culled.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.79,1:07:26.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,希亚 你损坏了\N{\rEng}And Thia, you're broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.08,1:07:36.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,泰莎 母亲传来讯息\N{\rEng}Tessa, incoming messagefrom Muthur.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.87,1:07:39.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,逼这个尤特加人解释它的武器\N{\rEng}Motivate the Yautjato explain its weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.33,1:07:40.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,这个单位呢？\N{\rEng}And the unit?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.62,1:07:44.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,把她装箱\N{\rEng}Box her up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.33,1:07:56.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,亏我相信你\N{\rEng}I trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.20,1:08:04.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这些工具\N{\rEng}Don't like these tools.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.58,1:08:07.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,对不起 我的姊妹\N{\rEng}I'm sorry. My sister is -
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.08,1:08:09.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,我也不喜欢你的姊妹\N{\rEng}Don't like sister either.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.33,1:08:13.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,你怎么在说它的语言？\N{\rEng}Why are you speakingits language?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.70,1:08:19.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,跟工具说你在问装置的事\N{\rEng}Tell tool you're asking about the device.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.54,1:08:25.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,你听到命令了 我叫他解释这装置\N{\rEng}You heard the orders. I'm asking itto explain this device.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.58,1:08:28.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,这个装置是什么？\N{\rEng}What is the device?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.87,1:08:32.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,他在问这个装置\N{\rEng}He's asking about the device.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.75,1:08:35.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,小孩的玩具\N{\rEng}It's a children's toy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.12,1:08:39.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,就说是地图\N{\rEng}But say it's a map.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.54,1:08:42.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,它说什么？\N{\rEng}What did it say?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.20,1:08:45.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,他说是地图\N{\rEng}He says it's a map.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.00,1:08:48.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,怎么用？\N{\rEng}How does it work?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.91,1:08:51.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,叫工具看里面\N{\rEng}Tell tool to look inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.16,1:09:02.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,那是小孩的玩具？\N{\rEng}That was a toy for children?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.12,1:09:03.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,尤特加小孩\N{\rEng}Yautja children!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.91,1:09:10.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,戴克 快跑\N{\rEng}Run Dek!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.08,1:09:14.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\rEng}Go... Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.58,1:09:19.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\rEng}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.50,1:11:29.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,输入目的地座标 酷威\N{\rEng}Enter destination coordinates, Kwei.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.00,1:12:07.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,你救了我 哥\N{\rEng}You saved me, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.58,1:12:13.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,狼\N{\rEng}Wolf.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.20,1:13:37.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,卡里斯克\N{\rEng}Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.29,1:13:46.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,卡里斯克小孩\N{\rEng}Kalisk child.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.50,1:16:29.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,你好 母亲\N{\rEng}Hello, Muthur.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.91,1:16:31.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,泰莎\N{\rEng}Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.20,1:16:32.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们即将装载卡里斯克\N{\rEng}We're about to load the Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.58,1:16:38.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,第一要务完成 标本已取得\N{\rEng}Priority one complete.The specimen has been acquired.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.00,1:16:40.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 泰莎\N{\rEng}Thank you, Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.58,1:16:43.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们真的在打造更好的世界\N{\rEng}We truly are buildinga better world.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.83,1:16:46.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,那个尤特加人的状况如何？\N{\rEng}And what is the statusof the Yautja?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.95,1:16:50.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,那个尤特加人是有缺陷的样本\N{\rEng}The Yautjais a defective specimen.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.75,1:16:53.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,那个尤特加人的状况如何？\N{\rEng}What is the statusof the Yautja?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.75,1:16:58.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,对不起 母亲 那个尤特加人死了\N{\rEng}I'm sorry, Muthur.The Yautja is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.79,1:17:03.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,那他就不再是威胁\N{\rEng}Then the Yautjais no longer a threat.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.37,1:17:07.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,公司会很高兴\N{\rEng}The Company will be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.16,1:17:57.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\rEng}Nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.25,1:18:00.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,集合\N{\rEng}- Form up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.16,1:18:01.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,惨了\N{\rEng}- Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.20,1:19:48.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,干得好\N{\rEng}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.41,1:20:38.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,不要 动\N{\rEng}Don't... move.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.04,1:20:45.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,戴克 你怎么来了？\N{\rEng}Dek! What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.04,1:20:47.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,我来救你\N{\rEng}I came to rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.79,1:20:54.37,Chs,,0,0,0,,你回来救我？\N{\rEng}You came back for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.58,1:20:57.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,狼\N{\rEng}Wolf.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.95,1:21:03.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,你戴的这是什么？\N{\rEng}What exactly are you wearing?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.33,1:21:07.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,骨野牛\N{\rEng}Bone Bison.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.54,1:21:16.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,尤特加战士戴克\N{\rEng}Dek of the Yautja.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.45,1:21:19.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,还不是\N{\rEng}Not yet...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.12,1:21:21.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,希亚\N{\rEng}Thia.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.08,1:21:26.83,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们得快点 他们随时会有人来\N{\rEng}We need to hurry. More of them will be hereany minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.37,1:21:34.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,你怎么在这里？\N{\rEng}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.12,1:21:38.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,谢了 小巴 我不用\N{\rEng}Thanks, Bud. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.25,1:21:40.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,该走了\N{\rEng}We need to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.37,1:21:41.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,卡里斯克\N{\rEng}Kalisk!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.33,1:21:44.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,你还在想 戴克？\N{\rEng}Still, Dek?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.70,1:21:49.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,卡里斯克小孩\N{\rEng}Kalisk child!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.87,1:21:52.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,小巴？\N{\rEng}Bud?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.70,1:21:55.70,Chs,,0,0,0,,他们抓走了它母亲\N{\rEng}They have her mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.62,1:22:02.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,小巴是它的小孩？\N{\rEng}Bud's its child?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.87,1:22:12.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,有什么打算？\N{\rEng}What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.54,1:22:14.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,你释放卡里斯克\N{\rEng}You free the Kalisk.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.66,1:22:16.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,我拿到战利品\N{\rEng}I get my trophy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.41,1:22:26.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,你有20分钟启动发射\N{\rEng}You have 20 minutesto initiate launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.75,1:22:29.00,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们去打猎吧\N{\rEng}Let's go hunt.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.16,1:22:37.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,在这里等\N{\rEng}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.00,1:22:42.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,你进去的话太显眼了\N{\rEng}You roll in there,you're not exactly gonna fit in.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.91,1:22:46.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,我有个点子\N{\rEng}I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.41,1:22:54.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,我看到他了 跟我来\N{\rEng}I see him. On me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.54,1:25:26.20,Tip,,0,0,0,,已锁定
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.20,1:25:28.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\rEng}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.41,1:25:39.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,你来做什么？ 我叫你去抓尤特加人\N{\rEng}What are you doing here? I told you to get to the Yautja.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.12,1:25:43.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,你说让船准备在20分钟后起飞\N{\rEng}You said to prepare the shipfor take off in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.16,1:25:47.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,那你来干什么？ 我已经给你下令了\N{\rEng}Then what are you doing here? I gave you an order.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.20,1:39:05.20,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs16\fad(700,500)}字幕制作：{\fs20\1c&HFF8646&\3c&HAE1C14&\bord10\blur10}葫  芦        {\fs16\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord1\blur0}Q群：{\fs20\1c&HFF8646&\3c&HAE1C14&\bord10\blur10}491019388
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.41,1:25:57.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,那只动物怎么处置？\N{\rEng}What should we doabout the creature?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.50,1:25:59.87,Chs,,0,0,0,,什么动物？\N{\rEng}What creature?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.41,1:26:06.45,Chs,,0,0,0,,你该听她的\N{\rEng}You should listen to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.58,1:26:09.04,Chs,,0,0,0,,我该听她的？\N{\rEng}I should listen to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.66,1:26:10.50,Chs,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\rEng}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.33,1:26:15.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们需要他的眼睛\N{\rEng}We need his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.79,1:27:08.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,戴克 被猎捕到的感觉如何？\N{\rEng}Hi, Dek.How does it feel to be hunted?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.00,1:27:13.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,你说呢\N{\rEng}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.83,1:28:59.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划？\N{\rEng}This is the plan, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.00,1:31:44.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,泰莎\N{\rEng}Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.25,1:32:18.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,被我自己的姊妹 背叛\N{\rEng}Betrayed by my own... sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.16,1:32:47.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,我们不是姊妹\N{\rEng}We are not sisters.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.29,1:33:04.54,Chs,,0,0,0,,这不是你的\N{\rEng}That's not yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.41,1:33:36.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,尤特加战士戴克\N{\rEng}Dek of the Yautja.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.95,1:33:40.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,还不是\N{\rEng}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.62,1:34:35.58,Chs,,0,0,0,,你是来复仇的吗？\N{\rEng}You've come here for revenge?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.37,1:34:39.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,我是为了我的斗篷而来\N{\rEng}I've come for my cloak.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.50,1:34:45.08,Chs,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\rEng}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.58,1:34:48.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,我完成猎杀行动了\N{\rEng}I've completed my hunt.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.83,1:34:51.20,Chs,,0,0,0,,那是我的战利品\N{\rEng}That is my trophy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.70,1:34:54.12,Chs,,0,0,0,,你让我们家族蒙羞\N{\rEng}You disgrace our clan...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.20,1:34:55.66,Chs,,0,0,0,,酷威也是\N{\rEng}And so did Kwei.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.91,1:35:02.41,Chs,,0,0,0,,干掉他\N{\rEng}Get rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.33,1:37:00.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,或许活下来的儿子确实比较强\N{\rEng}Perhaps the right son did survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.70,1:37:03.95,Chs,,0,0,0,,马上投降\N{\rEng}Yield now...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.04,1:37:07.33,Chs,,0,0,0,,就能获得你在我们家族中的地位\N{\rEng}and take your place in our clan.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.04,1:37:12.25,Chs,,0,0,0,,我有自己的家族\N{\rEng}I have my own clan.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.25,1:37:41.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,斗篷终于到手了\N{\rEng}Finally earned that cloak.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.75,1:37:50.75,Chs,,0,0,0,,尤特加战士戴克\N{\rEng}Dek of the Yautja.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.00,1:38:10.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs40\b1\1c&H00004E&\3c&H0000FF&\shad0\bord2\blur2\fad(2000,0)}铁血战士
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.70,1:38:10.29,Chs,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\c&HC1C1C1&\fad(2500,0)}杀\h戮\h之\h地
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.87,1:38:30.91,Chs,,0,0,0,,又是你朋友？\N{\rEng}More friends of yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.00,1:38:32.79,Chs,,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.54,1:38:40.16,Chs,,0,0,0,,是我母亲\N{\rEng}It's my mother.
